DESCRIPTION:Join us on the Tsuru Family Terrace (wooden deck by the lawn) i
	n the Commons for Zumba with Tiny Fitness. \n📍 Tsuru Family Terrace\n Satu
	rday\, August 8\n⏰ 9:30 – 10:30 a.m.\n🎟️ Free Community Session \nParking:\
	nFree parking available across the street from the Commons in Lot S (6215 
	Main St\, Houston\, TX 77030). Additional street parking available along M
	ain Street.\n\nhttps://hermannpark.org/event/zumba-with-tiny-fitness-2/\n\
